   "text": "D0 is the nominal physics default. Residual and adaptive\nalternatives exist offline, but clean-case improvements did\nnot satisfy every delay, heading and runtime gate.",
   "originalText": "D0 is the nominal physics default. Residual and adaptive\nalternatives exist offline, but clean-case improvements did\nnot satisfy every delay, heading and runtime gate.",
